-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",288,{
[9185]="7001A9AA\n1\tDeliver the goods to Watcher Oakdale\030Collect caravan-goods (total: 30)\tSeek out stolen caravan goods within the walls of the Southwatch and carried by the enemies making the ruins their home. Return all that you find to Watcher Oakdale to east of the north entrance of the ruins. Caravans cannot all afford to pass through the gates and those that cannot lose their goods to the brigands and all of Bree-land suffers.\n",
[9186]="70068BB1\n1\tDefeat ruffians in the Fleet-fast (total: 8)\030Defeat Fleet-fast bruisers (total: 2)\tMany of the ruffians in the Fleet-fast conducted a mutiny against Kenza and she wants you to deal with them.\n2\tTalk to Kenza in the Fleet-fast\tKenza is by the stairs leading to the upper level in the Fleet-fast.\n",
[9187]="70048C91\n1\tCollect Uruk fangs (total: 10)\030Collect infected Orc fangs (total: 10)\tOrcs and Uruks can be found in many areas of Agarnaith. You should collect Orc and Uruk fangs as proof of their deaths.\n2\tTalk to Ghai-buri-Sêk\tGhai-buri-Sêk can be found outside the mountain pass in Agarnaith. You should bring Ghai-buri-Sêk the fangs you collected.\n",
[9188]="7001A4AD\n1\tDefeat Blackmaw at the Packhowler's Hill\030Defeat wolves in the Dourstocks (total: 10)\tBlack wolves can be found throughout the Dourstocks. Blackmaw can be found at the Packhowler's Hill, some distance to the south-east from Echad Mothelen. Lavanferon has asked you to defeat many wolves and their pack-leader, Blackmaw.\n2\tTalk to Lavanferon at Echad Mothelen\tLavanferon is at Echad Mothelen, some distance north-west from the Packhowler's Hill. You should return to Lavanferon with news of your success.\n",
[9189]="7001B0F3\n1\tTalk to Andreg at the Greenway Fort\tAndreg waits at his post at the Greenway Fort, north along the Greenway from Saeradan's Cabin. Saeradan sent you to assist Andreg, one of his kindred.\n",
[9190]="7001BBAF\n1\tTalk to Hunulf Munce\tHunulf Munce is at the camp on the eastern side of Minas Eriol. Gadaric Munce sent you to speak with his brother Hunulf.\n",
[9191]="7001BBAC\n1\tTalk to Deputy Osmann\tDeputy Osmann is at the camp on the east side of Minas Eriol. Constable Bram Ashleaf sent you to aid his deputy. He thinks that you will be able to see that the deputy keeps his charges safe and also assist him in his various tasks.\n",
[9192]="7000C377\n1\tTalk to Glóin in the Misty Mountains\030Talk to Dwalin\tDwalin is at Thorin's Hall far to the west, beyond the Shire. Glóin is at his camp north of Rivendell. Bilbo Baggins would like to know if his dwarf-friends Dwalin and Glóin have any recollections which would make good additions to his book.\n2\tTalk to Bilbo Baggins in Rivendell\tBilbo Baggins is at Rivendell in the Trollshaws, south of Glóin's camp and far to the east of Thorin's Hall. Dwalin and Glóin both shared stories of their adventure in Goblin-town. Now you should return to Bilbo.\n",
[9193]="70000D66\n1\tTalk to Wilcome Tunnelly\030Collect lunch basket\tWilcome Tunnelly is the supervisor of the quarry in Scary, to the north-east. Gammer Tunnelly has asked you to bring the lunch she prepared to her grandson Wilcome, in Scary.\n",
[9194]="700001AC\n1\tFind Dírdrë\tDírdrë might be found in Nan Gurth, south-east of Carn Dûm. Éa's daughter was taken from her many years ago. It could be that Dírdrë still lives.\n",
[9195]="70066771\n1\tRetrieve Aradax's woodworking tools\tAradax has asked you to retrieve his woodworking tools from Tathrendalf to the north-east.\n2\tTalk to Aradax\tYou have retrieved Aradax's woodworking tools from Tathrendalf. Talk to Aradax in Lothgobel.\n",
[9196]="7006C6E4\n1\tAshâmi asked that you speak with Raphûz at Shonith\tAshâmi accepted Raphûz's apology and seems genuinely concerned about him. She asked you to speak with him while she prepares a message for her father.\n2\tSpeak with Ashâmi at the oasis of Shonith\tRaphûz suggests an alternate plan and wants you to share it with Ashâmi. He asked you to speak to her at the oasis Shonith.\n3\tSpeak with Raphûz at the oasis Shonith\tAshâmi realized what Raphûz delivering the message to her father would mean. She accepted the offer. You should return to Raphûz at the oasis Shonith and inform him.\n4\tMake your way to Igbâl's home in Jirush\tRaphûz plans to deliver the Aladi head to Igbâl at the merchant's home in Jirush. He asked you to meet him there to bear witness and to support the ruse he and Ashâmi concocted.\n5\tSpeak with the translator, Galamê, at Igbâl's home in Jirush\tYou arrived at Igbâl's home after Raphûz delivered the news of Ashâmi and provided the \"proof\" of the Alad's death. The mood is somber. Galamê stands ready to speak with you.\n6\tSpeak with Raphûz at Igbâl's home in Jirush\tGalamê explained that Igbâl believes his daughter is dead and that you and Raphûz avenged her death by slaughtering the Alad. The ruse was successful. Raphûz waits for you to speak with him at Igbâl's home.\n7\tTalk to Ashâmi in Shonith\tRaphûz said Igbâl cited portents in the sky and on the earth that reinforced the story you shared. He wants you to return to Shonith to tell Ashâmi what occurred.\n",
[9197]="7000E5EF\n1\tRecover Gránung\tDéornyd thinks his sister's sword is still in or around the ice canyons, south of Pynti-peldot. Déornyd has asked you to find his sister's sword and return it to him.\n2\tTalk to Déornyd\030Collect Gránung\tDéornyd is at Pynti-peldot, north of the ice canyons. You have found Gránung and should now return it to Déornyd at Pynti-peldot.\n",
[9198]="70058511\n1\tApproach Lúkhag\tLúkhag hangs from a tree in front of Annâk-khurfu. You should go to her and see where she'll lead you.\n2\tTalk to Rékkur\tYou should inform Rékkur of what you've learned about Gáfin's discovery.\n",
[9199]="7004AB9A\n1\tInvestigate the strange lights\tStrange lights have been seen in part of Talath Úrui. You should investigate these lights.\n2\tDefeat the fires (total: 8)\tDefeat the living fires of the Ghâshghurm.\n",
[9200]="70028186\n1\tExamine disturbed piles of earth (total: 3)\030Examine remains\tSigns of the strange happenings might be found in the Bonevales, west of Bledhun. Bledhun has asked you to seek out and discover any signs of the strange happenings in the Bonevales.\n2\tTalk to Caron in the Bonevales\tCaron awaits you to the north-west of the area you searched. You should seek out Caron, as Bledhun instructed, and discuss what you have found.\n",
[9201]="70027E09\n1\tCollect strange ore (total: 10)\tOre can be found throughout the Orc-mines. Ondor the Dwarf asked you to bring him some of the mysterious ore the Orcs are mining.\n2\tBring the ore to Ondor in the Orc-mines\tOndor the Dwarf is in the Orc-mines. You should bring the ore you collected to Ondor.\n",
[9202]="70024BA8\n1\tTalk to Brungos\tThe Ranger Brungos has discovered an unsettling relic in Thrór's Coomb.\n",
[9203]="70024BA6\n1\tTalk to Noora\tThe Lossoth study the mysterious relic they have found within the walls of the Ironspan.\n",
[9204]="70024BA5\n1\tTalk to Ted Farmer\tTed Farmer is outside the cottage he was dwelling in with his brother Burt, staring at the frightening relic someone placed there as the cottage burned.\n",
[9205]="70024BA4\n1\tTalk to Bungo Grubb\tBungo Grubb cannot believe the frightening relic that appeared in his pipe-weed field in Oatbarton.\n",
[9206]="70024BA9\n1\tExamine the sealed door in the depths of the Laenan caves\tThe door in the depths of the Laenan caves occupies your thoughts.\n2\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond is in his library in the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. You have found a mysterious relic in front of the sealed door in the depths of the Laenan caves, and should tell Elrond of it.\n",
[9207]="70022A91\n1\tTalk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs\tMincham's camp is located north and west of the main road, in the north-west portion of the Lich Bluffs. You should return to Mincham and provide him with a sample of the foul liquid that you have recovered.\n",
[9208]="7006BB5C\n1\tDiscover clues along the river (total: 3)\tEdâkhi has asked you to look for clues to Enârshan's whereabouts near along the river.\n2\tDiscover additional clues along the river (total: 3)\tLook for additional clues to Enârshan's whereabouts along the river for Edâkhi.\n3\tDiscover additional clues near the Falls of Ilûritu (total: 2)\tLook for clues to Enârshan's whereabouts near the waterfall for Edâkhi.\n4\tReturn to Edâkhi with what you learned\tReturn to Edâkhi and tell her about what you have learned about the river-maiden, Enârshan.\n",
[9209]="7002729C\n1\tExamine the cauldron\030Examine the first altar\030Examine the second altar\030Examine the third altar\tThe cauldron and altars which Andreg mentioned can be found between the great trees at the heart of the Slade of Shadows. Andreg has instructed you to try and examine the altars and cauldron within the Slade of Shadows to learn what purpose they serve.\n",
[9210]="7000135C\n1\tDiscover the library of Múl Kholuim\tMúl Kholuim has his camp inside a ruin in some high hills south of the large lake in Imlad Balchorth, west from Myrkworth. Birgir has asked you to find the camp of the Angmarim keeper of books.\n2\tDefeat Múl Kholuim\tYou have found Múl Kholuim's camp inside a ruin in the high hills south of the large lake in Imlad Balchorth. Birgir has asked you to defeat Múl Kholuim. He also warned you to gather allies.\n3\tTalk to Birgir\tBirgir is at Myrkworth, north-east from Múl Kholuim's camp. Having defeated Múl Kholuim, you should return to Birgir.\n",
[9211]="700654B7\n1\tPick up the crate\tDingási has asked you to bring a crate of carrots from the Harlond's provisioner and bring it back to the mûmak. The crate is next to the provisioner, in the Harlond, and the mûmak is north of the Harlond's walls.\n2\tReturn to Dingási\tYou should let Dingási know that Lokhûr is happily munching away at the carrots and other vegetables you brought from the provisioner. Dingási is in the Harlond.\n",
[9212]="70070CB1\n1\tDeliver the ossified claws to a collection box\030Collect ossified claws (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire ossified claws for Hamât Renewed.\n",
[9213]="70070CB8\n1\tDeliver the sand-filled ears to a collection box\030Collect sand-filled ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire sand-filled ears for Hamât Renewed.\n",
[9214]="70070CB5\n1\tDeliver the sandy goo piles to a collection box\030Collect sandy goo piles (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire sandy goo for Hamât Renewed.\n",
[9215]="70070CB7\n1\tDeliver the sun-baked axes to a collection box\030Collect sun-baked axes (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire sun-baked axes for Hamât Renewed.\n",
[9216]="70070CB0\n1\tDeliver the sun-dried hides to a collection box\030Collect sun-dried hides (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire sun-dried hides for Hamât Renewed.\n",
})
